  "articleBody": "Replacing a bathtub is rarely just a fixture swap: the final scope can include demolition, plumbing connections, waterproofing, wall finishes, flooring repairs, and permit coordination. Before hiring, compare providers on the proposed tub, drain and valve compatibility, concealed-condition allowances, finish details, inspection responsibility, and how design and construction will be coordinated.",
